WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.460
passed, and it was soon spring.

2
00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:22.042
The air grew warm, flowers bloomed, and birds swooped from tree to tree.

3
00:00:24.363 --> 00:00:28.224
The road Wukong and the others were traveling began to go up a mountain.

4
00:00:31.028 --> 00:00:31.809
stopped the group.

5
00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:34.671
"Bajie, go up the road and search the mountain.

6
00:00:35.491 --> 00:00:38.573
There might be a demon up there, and I don't want Master to get hurt."

7
00:00:40.454 --> 00:00:41.134
moaned the pig.

8
00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:43.616
"You make me do all the hard work."

9
00:00:45.237 --> 00:00:48.119
Dragging his feet, he headed up the mountain road.

10
00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.001
turned to the Tang Monk and Wujing.

11
00:00:52.021 --> 00:00:54.562
"I'm going to follow the pig.

12
00:00:54.642 --> 00:00:56.904
I want to make sure he really searches the mountain."

13
00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:02.555
The monkey turned invisible and followed Bajie up the road.

14
00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.701
The pig walked for a few minutes.

15
00:01:12.283 --> 00:01:15.505
When he was sure his companions wouldn't hear him, he turned around.

16
00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:17.747
"You dummies!"

17
00:01:18.008 --> 00:01:18.788
shouted Bajie.

18
00:01:19.749 --> 00:01:21.210
make me do all the hard work!

19
00:01:21.911 --> 00:01:22.631
Well, guess what?

20
00:01:23.492 --> 00:01:24.993
not going to search this mountain.

21
00:01:26.074 --> 00:01:29.076
I'm going to take a nap instead.

22
00:01:29.176 --> 00:01:32.839
And when I come back, I'll lie and say I searched the mountain!"

23
00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:36.082
found a big log.

24
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:50.654
He lay down behind it and fell fast asleep.

25
00:01:53.896 --> 00:01:56.358
pig is so lazy," thought Wukong.

26
00:01:56.378 --> 00:01:58.780
"I'll teach him a lesson."

27
00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:02.322
The monkey turned himself into a woodpecker and pecked the log.

28
00:02:03.483 --> 00:02:04.503
Tap, tap, tap!

29
00:02:04.543 --> 00:02:10.687
Tap, tap, Bajie rolled over and mumbled.

30
00:02:12.068 --> 00:02:12.588
pecked again.

31
00:02:13.849 --> 00:02:14.849
Tap, tap, tap!

32
00:02:14.869 --> 00:02:18.652
Tap, tap, pig sat up.

33
00:02:18.672 --> 00:02:21.233
"Quit tapping, you annoying woodpecker!

34
00:02:22.274 --> 00:02:23.314
trying to sleep!"

35
00:02:24.595 --> 00:02:28.160
He fell asleep again.

36
00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.821
landed on Bajie's head.

37
00:02:30.721 --> 00:02:31.682
Tap, tap, tap!

38
00:02:31.702 --> 00:02:34.243
Tap, tap, "Ouch!"

39
00:02:34.783 --> 00:02:36.784
cried the pig, jumping to his feet.

40
00:02:38.164 --> 00:02:39.245
Wukong flew away.

41
00:02:40.925 --> 00:02:41.606
rubbed his head.

42
00:02:41.626 --> 00:02:46.127
"I can't even take a nap!"

43
00:02:46.688 --> 00:02:47.328
He sighed.

44
00:02:47.348 --> 00:02:49.289
"I guess I'll go back down."

45
00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:54.671
When Bajie found his companions, he lied.

46
00:02:54.691 --> 00:02:58.312
"I searched the entire mountain," he said.

47
00:02:58.332 --> 00:02:59.673
"It's safe."

48
00:03:01.193 --> 00:03:03.414
"Did you see any demons or monsters?"

49
00:03:03.795 --> 00:03:04.595
asked Wukong.

50
00:03:05.435 --> 00:03:06.536
Bajie shook his head.

51
00:03:08.597 --> 00:03:10.217
about woodpeckers?"

52
00:03:10.697 --> 00:03:11.398
asked the monkey.

53
00:03:11.418 --> 00:03:13.419
"Did you see any of them?"

54
00:03:14.699 --> 00:03:16.040
pig looked surprised.

55
00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.742
"What how did you "That was me, Bajie!"

56
00:03:21.082 --> 00:03:22.002
shouted Wukong.

57
00:03:23.023 --> 00:03:23.843
took a nap!

58
00:03:24.603 --> 00:03:28.168
You didn't search the mountain at all!"

59
00:03:28.248 --> 00:03:29.169
Bajie hung his head.

60
00:03:29.189 --> 00:03:34.171
"You should be ashamed of yourself, Bajie," said Wujing.

61
00:03:35.131 --> 00:03:36.492
Tang Monk frowned.

62
00:03:36.512 --> 00:03:39.213
"Please go back and search the mountain, Bajie."

63
00:03:40.193 --> 00:03:42.054
The pig headed back up the road.

64
00:03:48.036 --> 00:03:50.397
He had walked for a while when he saw a fox.

65
00:03:50.417 --> 00:03:54.499
"I know that's you, Wukong!"

66
00:03:54.779 --> 00:03:55.379
he shouted.

67
00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.340
swung his rake.

68
00:03:58.092 --> 00:03:59.333
The fox trotted away.

69
00:04:00.613 --> 00:04:02.474
A robin flew past Bajie's head.

70
00:04:02.494 --> 00:04:06.155
"Get away from me, Wukong!"

71
00:04:06.496 --> 00:04:07.196
yelled the pig.

72
00:04:08.416 --> 00:04:11.758
As he waved the rake at the bird, Bajie tripped and fell.

73
00:04:11.778 --> 00:04:15.639
"Wukong!" shouted the pig.

74
00:04:16.179 --> 00:04:16.900
know you're here.

75
00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:20.241
You're invisible, and you just tripped me."

76
00:04:21.322 --> 00:04:23.723
He got back up and stood still for a moment.

77
00:04:24.963 --> 00:04:28.325
When he didn't see or hear Wukong, he continued walking.

78
00:04:31.686 --> 00:04:35.588
Every time Bajie saw an animal, he waved his rake and yelled.

79
00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.630
road became very steep.

80
00:04:44.291 --> 00:04:46.092
The pig soon came to a cave.

81
00:04:46.932 --> 00:04:49.013
In front of the cave was a demon.

82
00:04:52.114 --> 00:04:52.895
held out his rake.

83
00:04:52.915 --> 00:04:54.675
"Tell me who you are!"

84
00:04:54.936 --> 00:04:56.884
he demanded.

85
00:04:57.284 --> 00:05:00.026
name is Golden Horn," said the demon.

86
00:05:00.046 --> 00:05:01.426
"Who are you?"

87
00:05:01.506 --> 00:05:05.188
"I am Zhu Bajie," said the pig.

88
00:05:05.208 --> 00:05:08.789
"I'm traveling to the Western Paradise with the Tang Monk."

89
00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:15.192
the Tang Monk A smile curled along the demon's lips.

90
00:05:16.733 --> 00:05:22.435
"I have heard that anyone who eats the Tang Monk will live forever."
